{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:48 2026-06-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:48 2026-06-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:48 2026-06-03 HKT</p><p>今日（3日）中午12時06分，位於尖沙咀東部科學館道2號的香港科學館，館內傳出陣陣燒焦氣味。當時入場參觀的人士眾多，在場市民和職員隨即緊急疏散。警方及消防接報趕到，發現燒焦氣味來自天台中央冷氣。現場消息稱，人員經調查後相信是有中央冷氣機皮帶斷裂，不斷磨擦冒煙產生燒焦氣味，並吹入館內。</p><p>據悉，今日整個早上入場人數大約2,000人，事件中約200人需要疏散離開，幸無人受傷。</p><img alt=\"現場是香港科學館。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d9000a45674698f8c267edc4a2321710/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_13_23_04_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/675369da03a4fb3dfbcec4ffec2c898f/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_13_23_03_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/13deeb3cc662f4753c0e351ef0746fea/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_13_23_03_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a11c1981ad55606f62c6c7a8309ae307/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_13_23_03.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/dfe2527ba3d2b22e826bc4d035571cf8/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_13_23_02_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"科學館中央冷氣機皮帶斷裂，不斷磨擦冒煙產生燒焦氣味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/16c85dea56a176d12eca3513531b9b83/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_13_23_02_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/92733ca7c1cbf2510e6a7fe7b58d784c/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_13_23_04.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工程人員事後檢修設備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5c81bb29eabd19b092573b16ae1ca65e/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_13_23_01_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5587b737235ed58e6287401611affdbf/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_13_23_01_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b328cdfc8963fe9911fcfb310f2824ee/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_13_23_00_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3188eab1fd8d9928770c5ee7c8a98b8d/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_13_23_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"事發時有大批學生參觀，約200人疏散。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9ebb905966c9d3750e8ce39c5461bdb0/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_13_22_59.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-03T05:58:24.046006+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}